+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+Binding behaviour lives in `.feature` specs and referenced `assets/**`. History lives in git. These notes carry only what the next cycle needs.
+
+## Voyage 1
+
+- **Base commit:** 803912f (todomvc: empty project with spec + template assets)
+- **Goal:** Build a vanilla JavaScript TodoMVC app per `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as base markup. localStorage persistence. No preprocessors.
+- **Specs authored:** 8 feature files, 30 scenarios total.
+- **Watchbill:** 4 watches, ordered: new-todo, item+toggle-all, editing+counter+clear-completed, toggle-all+clear-remaining+routing+persistence.
+- **localStorage key:** `todos-vanillajs` (per app-spec.md convention).
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Vanilla JavaScript, no frameworks. Single `js/app.js` file plus `css/app.css`.
+- Routes implemented via `hashchange` listener (no external routing library).
+- localStorage key: `todos-vanillajs`.
+- Templates from `assets/app-template.index.html` adapted as `index.html` at project root.
+- Verification tier: `@logic` (happy-dom), sufficient for DOM-level behaviour.
+
+## Pending
+
+- No production code yet. First QM dispatch writes step definitions, implements the app, and proves the watchbill.
diff --git a/features/clear-completed.feature b/features/clear-completed.feature
