@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+Feature: New todo
+  As a user
+  I want to add new todos to my list
+  So that I can track what needs to be done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: New todo input is focused on page load
+    Then the new todo input should be focused
+
+  Scenario: Creating a new todo by pressing Enter
+    When the user types "Buy groceries" in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then a todo "Buy groceries" should exist in the list
+    And the new todo input should be empty
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input is ignored
+    When the user types "   " in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then no todo should exist in the list
+    And the main section should be hidden
+    And the footer should be hidden
+
+  Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating
+    When the user types "  Buy groceries  " in the new todo input
+    And the user presses Enter
+    Then a todo "Buy groceries" should exist in the list
+
+  Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+    When the user presses Enter
+    Then no todo should exist in the list
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Then the main section should be hidden
+    And the footer should be hidden
diff --git a/features/persistence.feature b/features/persistence.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fe53404
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+Feature: Persistence
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to be saved between page loads
+  So that I don't lose my data
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Scenario: Todos persist after reloading the app
+    Given the user has created a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has created a todo "Walk the dog"
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then a todo "Buy groceries" should exist in the list
+    And a todo "Walk the dog" should exist in the list
+
+  Scenario: Completed state persists after reloading
+    Given the user has created a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo "Buy groceries" should be completed
+
+  Scenario: Persisted data uses the correct localStorage key
+    Given the user has created a todo "Buy groceries"
+    Then localStorage should contain the key "todos-vanillajs"
+
+  Scenario: Filter state persists after reloading
+    Given the user has created a todo "Buy groceries"
+    And the user has created a todo "Walk the dog"
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" is completed
+    And the user navigates to "#/active"
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then the "Active" filter should be selected
+    And the todo "Buy groceries" should not be visible
+    And the todo "Walk the dog" should be visible
diff --git a/features/routing.feature b/features/routing.feature
new file mode 100644
